      "html": "<section class=\"slide is-active\">\n<style>\n/* ── Dark theme: override pastel-card tokens ── */\n.d-pastel-card {\n  --bg: #0d1117;\n  --surface: #161b22;\n  --surface-2: #21262d;\n  --border: #30363d;\n  --border-strong: #484f58;\n  --text-1: #e6edf3;\n  --text-2: #8b949e;\n  --text-3: #484f58;\n  --accent: #7c3aed;\n  --accent-2: #a855f7;\n  --accent-3: #c084fc;\n  --grad: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7 0%, #60a5fa 55%, #34d399 100%);\n  --shadow: none;\n  --shadow-lg: none;\n  --font-display: 'Inter','Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;\n  --font-sans: 'Inter','Noto Sans SC','PingFang SC',-apple-system,sans-serif;\n  --font-serif: 'Inter','Noto Sans SC',sans-serif;\n  --radius: 14px;\n  --radius-sm: 10px;\n  --radius-lg: 20px;\n  --pc-peach: rgba(124,58,237,.15); --pc-peach-d: #7c3aed;\n  --pc-mint: rgba(63,185,80,.15); --pc-mint-d: #3fb950;\n  --pc-sky: rgba(88,166,255,.15); --pc-sky-d: #58a6ff;\n  --pc-lilac: rgba(168,85,247,.15); --pc-lilac-d: #a855f7;\n  --pc-lemon: rgba(251,191,36,.15); --pc-lemon-d: #fbbf24;\n  --pc-rose: rgba(248,113,113,.15); --pc-rose-d: #f87171;\n  --pc-code-bg: #010409;\n  background: var(--bg); color: var(--text-1);\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n}\n\n/* ── Hide pastel-card chrome (blobs, topbar, footer, kicker, divider) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .chr-blob { display: none; }\n.d-pastel-card .chr-topbar { display: none; }\n.d-pastel-card .chr-footer { display: none; }\n.d-pastel-card .chr-kicker { display: none; }\n.d-pastel-card .chr-divider { display: none; }\n\n/* ── Background glow + grid (replaces oc-cbg + oc-cgrid) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .slide .bg-glow {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;\n  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 28% 38%, rgba(124,58,237,.25) 0%, transparent 60%),\n              radial-gradient(ellipse at 72% 62%, rgba(88,166,255,.18) 0%, transparent 60%);\n}\n.d-pastel-card .slide .bg-grid {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;\n  background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(48,54,61,.4) 1px, transparent 1px),\n                    linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(48,54,61,.4) 1px, transparent 1px);\n  background-size: 60px 60px;\n  -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 35%, transparent 80%);\n  mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, black 35%, transparent 80%);\n}\n\n/* ── Slide defaults ── */\n.d-pastel-card .slide { padding: 64px 88px; align-items: center; text-align: center; overflow: hidden; }\n.d-pastel-card .slide > * { position: relative; z-index: 2; }\n\n/* ── Page number (replaces oc-snum) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .slide .pg-num {\n  position: absolute; top: 24px; right: 36px; z-index: 3;\n  color: var(--text-3); font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .1em;\n}\n\n/* ── Chip tag (replaces oc-tag) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .chr-chip {\n  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\n  font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent-3); background: rgba(124,58,237,.14);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(168,85,247,.3);\n  padding: 5px 16px; border-radius: 999px; margin-bottom: 22px;\n}\n.d-pastel-card .chr-chip::before { display: none; }\n\n/* ── Typography (replaces oc-h1 / oc-h2 / oc-sub) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .chr-title {\n  font-size: 72px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.08;\n  letter-spacing: -.02em; margin: 0 0 10px; font-family: var(--font-sans);\n}\n.d-pastel-card .chr-heading {\n  font-size: 44px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.18;\n  letter-spacing: -.015em; margin: 0 0 14px; font-family: var(--font-sans);\n}\n.d-pastel-card .chr-sub {\n  font-size: 19px; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.65;\n  max-width: 100%; font-family: var(--font-sans); margin-top: 14px;\n}\n\n/* ── Gradient text (replaces oc-g) ── */\n.c-grad {\n  background: var(--grad); -webkit-background-clip: text; background-clip: text;\n  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\n}\n\n/* ── Badge color variants (replaces oc-bp / oc-bb / oc-bg / oc-bo) ── */\n.c-badge { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 3px 11px; }\n.c-badge.blue  { background: rgba(88,166,255,.15); color: #58a6ff; border-color: rgba(88,166,255,.3); }\n.c-badge.green { background: rgba(63,185,80,.15); color: #3fb950; border-color: rgba(63,185,80,.3); }\n.c-badge.orange { background: rgba(249,115,22,.15); color: #f97316; border-color: rgba(249,115,22,.3); }\n.c-badge.accent { background: rgba(168,85,247,.15); color: #c084fc; border-color: rgba(168,85,247,.3); }\n\n/* ── Pill tags (replaces oc-pill) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .chr-pill {\n  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;\n  background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 18px;\n  font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-1);\n  margin: 4px 6px 4px 0;\n}\n\n/* ── Cards (replaces oc-card) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .c-card {\n  background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 14px; padding: 22px 26px;\n  text-align: left; position: relative; overflow: hidden;\n}\n.d-pastel-card .c-card::before {\n  content: ''; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 1px;\n  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(168,85,247,.4), transparent);\n}\n.d-pastel-card .c-card h4 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--text-1); font-family: var(--font-sans); }\n.d-pastel-card .c-card p { color: var(--text-2); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.65; font-family: var(--font-sans); }\n\n/* ── Grids (replaces oc-grid-2 / oc-grid-3) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .c-grid-2 { gap: 18px; margin-top: 24px; width: 100%; max-width: 1000px; }\n.d-pastel-card .c-grid-3 { gap: 16px; margin-top: 28px; width: 100%; max-width: 1080px; }\n\n/* ── Steps (replaces oc-steps / oc-step / oc-sn / oc-sc) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .c-steps {\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0;\n  width: 100%; max-width: 820px; text-align: left;\n}\n.d-pastel-card .c-step {\n  display: flex; gap: 20px; align-items: flex-start;\n  padding: 18px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n.d-pastel-card .c-step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n.d-pastel-card .c-step-num {\n  width: 36px; height: 36px; flex-shrink: 0; border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px;\n  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #58a6ff); color: #fff;\n}\n.d-pastel-card .c-step-content { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }\n.d-pastel-card .c-step-title { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--text-1); }\n.d-pastel-card .c-step-body { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-2); line-height: 1.6; }\n\n/* ── Code block (replaces oc-code) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .chr-codebox {\n  background: #010409; border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px 24px;\n  font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.85; color: #e6edf3;\n  width: 100%; max-width: 860px; text-align: left; margin-top: 18px;\n}\n.chr-codebox .cm { color: var(--text-3); }\n.chr-codebox .cc { color: #58a6ff; }\n.chr-codebox .cs { color: var(--accent-3); }\n\n/* ── Highlight / callout (replaces oc-hl) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .c-note {\n  background: rgba(124,58,237,.1); border: 1px solid rgba(168,85,247,.3);\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-2);\n  border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0; padding: 16px 22px;\n  font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;\n  max-width: 860px; text-align: left; color: var(--text-1);\n}\n.d-pastel-card .c-note b { color: var(--accent-3); }\n\n/* ── Quote (replaces oc-quote) ── */\n.d-pastel-card .c-quote {\n  font-size: 26px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.6;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans); font-style: normal;\n  padding: 0 36px; max-width: 800px;\n  text-align: center; color: var(--text-1);\n}\n.d-pastel-card .c-quote::before {\n  content: '\"'; position: absolute; left: -6px; top: -22px;\n  font-size: 78px; color: var(--accent); opacity: .4;\n  font-family: Georgia, serif; line-height: 1;\n}\n.d-pastel-card .c-quote-attr {\n  margin-top: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-2);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n/* ── Hero number (replaces oc-big) + KPI ── */\n.c-hero-num {\n  font-size: 140px; font-weight: 900; line-height: .95;\n  letter-spacing: -.04em; text-align: center;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans); color: var(--text-1);\n}\n.d-pastel-card .c-kpi { text-align: center; }\n.d-pastel-card .c-kpi-value {\n  font-size: 80px; font-weight: 900;\n  font-family: var(--font-sans);\n}\n.d-pastel-card .c-kpi-label {\n  font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-2); margin-top: 8px;\n}\n</style>\n    <div class=\"bg-glow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bg-grid\"></div>\n    <div class=\"pg-num\">01 / 08</div>\n    <div class=\"chr-chip\">● OBSIDIAN × CLAUDE · 第二大脑</div>\n    <h1 class=\"chr-title\">把 Obsidian 和 Claude<br>拧成 <span class=\"c-grad\">一条神经</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"chr-sub\" style=\"max-width:720px\">不是又一个 AI 笔记插件 —— 是让 Claude 真正理解你 vault 的结构、链接、双向引用，<br>然后在你想写东西之前就把资料准备好。</p>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:32px\">\n      <span class=\"chr-pill\">🧠 Markdown-native</span>\n      <span class=\"chr-pill\">⚡ MCP-ready</span>\n      <span class=\"chr-pill\">🔗 双链理解</span>\n    </div>\n  </section>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide\">\n    <div class=\"bg-glow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bg-grid\"></div>\n    <div class=\"pg-num\">02 / 08</div>\n    <div class=\"chr-chip\">● CHAPTER 01</div>\n    <h1 class=\"chr-title\" style=\"font-size:110px\">Why <span class=\"c-grad\">not</span> Notion?</h1>\n    <p class=\"chr-sub\">当你的知识多到会互相引用时，<br>「文件夹」就不够了，「数据库」也不是答案。</p>\n  </section>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide\">\n    <div class=\"bg-glow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bg-grid\"></div>\n    <div class=\"pg-num\">03 / 08</div>\n    <div class=\"chr-chip\">● COMPARE</div>\n    <h2 class=\"chr-heading\">Notion vs <span class=\"c-grad\">Obsidian</span> · 对 AI 友好度</h2>\n    <div class=\"c-grid-2\">\n      <div class=\"c-card\">\n        <span class=\"c-badge blue\">NOTION</span>\n        <h4>数据库原生</h4>\n        <p>适合结构化任务、团队协作，但是——<br>· AI 要走 API，拿不到实时全文<br>· 嵌套块结构复杂，token 成本高<br>· 本地化差，没法当长期记忆</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"c-card\" style=\"border-color:rgba(168,85,247,.35);background:rgba(124,58,237,.05)\">\n        <span class=\"c-badge accent\">OBSIDIAN</span>\n        <h4>纯 Markdown + 双链</h4>\n        <p>对 AI 天生友好 ——<br>· 所有东西就是文件，Claude 直接读<br>· 双链 = 天然 graph，抽实体几乎零成本<br>· 离线、可 git、可 diff、可回滚</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-note\" style=\"margin-top:26px\"><b>💡 关键洞察：</b>AI 不需要「更聪明的数据库」，它需要「能被它自己读懂的文件系统」。</div>\n  </section>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide\">\n    <div class=\"bg-glow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bg-grid\"></div>\n    <div class=\"pg-num\">04 / 08</div>\n    <div class=\"chr-chip\">● SETUP · 4 STEPS</div>\n    <h2 class=\"chr-heading\">从 0 到第一次「AI 写笔记」</h2>\n    <div class=\"c-steps\">\n      <div class=\"c-step\"><div class=\"c-step-num\">1</div><div class=\"c-step-content\"><div class=\"c-step-title\">装 Obsidian + 开 Local REST API 插件</div><div class=\"c-step-body\">社区插件，一个勾就开。它让外部进程能 read/write 你的 vault。</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"c-step\"><div class=\"c-step-num\">2</div><div class=\"c-step-content\"><div class=\"c-step-title\">接 Claude Desktop + obsidian-mcp server</div><div class=\"c-step-body\">MCP 一个配置文件就能接，token 填 vault 的 api key。</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"c-step\"><div class=\"c-step-num\">3</div><div class=\"c-step-content\"><div class=\"c-step-title\">装 5 个 obsidian-skills</div><div class=\"c-step-body\">markdown / bases / canvas / cli / defuddle —— 让 Claude 知道怎么正确使用 Obsidian。</div></div></div>\n      <div class=\"c-step\"><div class=\"c-step-num\">4</div><div class=\"c-step-content\"><div class=\"c-step-title\">让 Claude 自己整理一次</div><div class=\"c-step-body\">「帮我把最近 10 篇笔记里的重复概念合并，生成一张新的 MOC」—— 90 秒出结果。</div></div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide\">\n    <div class=\"bg-glow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bg-grid\"></div>\n    <div class=\"pg-num\">05 / 08</div>\n    <div class=\"chr-chip\">● MCP CONFIG</div>\n    <h2 class=\"chr-heading\">claude_desktop_config.json</h2>\n    <pre class=\"chr-codebox\"><span class=\"cm\">// ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json</span>\n{\n  <span class=\"cc\">\"mcpServers\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"cc\">\"obsidian\"</span>: {\n      <span class=\"cc\">\"command\"</span>: <span class=\"cs\">\"npx\"</span>,\n      <span class=\"cc\">\"args\"</span>: [<span class=\"cs\">\"-y\"</span>, <span class=\"cs\">\"@modelcontextprotocol/server-obsidian\"</span>],\n      <span class=\"cc\">\"env\"</span>: {\n        <span class=\"cc\">\"OBSIDIAN_API_KEY\"</span>: <span class=\"cs\">\"xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx\"</span>,\n        <span class=\"cc\">\"OBSIDIAN_HOST\"</span>: <span class=\"cs\">\"http://127.0.0.1:27123\"</span>\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}</pre>\n    <p class=\"chr-sub\" style=\"margin-top:18px;max-width:860px;font-size:19px\">重启 Claude Desktop，输入 <b style=\"color:var(--accent-3)\">/mcp</b>，你会看到 obsidian 已连。</p>\n  </section>"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<section class=\"slide\">\n    <div class=\"bg-glow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bg-grid\"></div>\n    <div class=\"pg-num\">06 / 08</div>\n    <div class=\"chr-chip\">● 3 MONTHS IN</div>\n    <h2 class=\"chr-heading\">跑了 90 天，我的 <span class=\"c-grad\">vault 数据</span></h2>\n    <div class=\"c-grid-3\" style=\"margin-top:28px\">\n      <div class=\"c-card\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <div class=\"c-kpi\"><div class=\"c-kpi-value c-grad\">1,842</div><div class=\"c-kpi-label\">notes in vault</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"c-card\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <div class=\"c-kpi\"><div class=\"c-kpi-value c-grad\">6.3k</div><div class=\"c-kpi-label\">backlinks (由 AI 自动补)</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"c-card\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n        <div class=\"c-kpi\"><div class=\"c-kpi-value c-grad\">-74%</div><div class=\"c-kpi-label\">找资料平均耗时</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-note\" style=\"margin-top:26px\">最大收益不是「AI 帮我写」，而是「AI 帮我把旧笔记重新连起来」—— 每周 30 分钟，vault 就会主动生长。</div>\n  </section>"
